---
import Layout from '@layouts/default.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Andrew Noblet"
  description="How this website handles appearance preferences, email inquiries, and appointment bookings."
>
  <article class="editorial-page editorial-section">
    <div class="section-heading"><h1 class="editorial-title">Privacy</h1></div>
    <div class="editorial-prose">
      <h2>Appearance preferences</h2>
      <p>
        This site saves appearance choices, such as theme and text size, in your
        browser. You can reset them in <a href="/settings"
          >Accessibility settings</a
        > or clear them through your browser settings.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact and appointment bookings</h2>
      <p>
        If you email me, I use the information you share to respond and discuss
        your request. If you book a call, Google Calendar handles the booking. I
        use the appointment details to arrange the call and follow up about your
        inquiry.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions about your information</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:andrewbnoblet@gmail.com"
          >andrewbnoblet@gmail.com</a
        > with privacy questions or to ask about information you shared with me.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
